{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37867","headline":"题故李宾客庐山草堂 · 许彬","name":"题故李宾客庐山草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"难穷林下趣，坐使致君恩。\n术业行当代，封章动谏垣。\n已明邪佞迹，几雪薜萝冤。\n报主深知此，忧民讵可论。\n名将山共古，迹与道俱存。\n爲谢重来者，何人更及门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}